Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.95,0:00:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.55,0:00:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.61,0:01:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is way too intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.23,0:01:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, Tristan, Yugi\Nbeat Kaiba once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.77,0:01:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to beat Kaiba all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.61,0:01:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with Kaiba anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.33,0:01:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He claims that he's changed,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.21,0:01:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's acting like the same old\Ncreep we used to know and loathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.85,0:01:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.93,0:01:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, look at these two jokers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.85,0:01:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They're really going at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.53,0:01:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.03,0:01:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I got the best seat in the house\Nfor scoping out the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.95,0:01:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's trying to finish me off as quickly\Nas possible, and that's not like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.11,0:01:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He enjoys toying with his opponents\Nalmost as much as he enjoys winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.03,0:01:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time we dueled, he spent half the\Nmatch messing with me, but this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.19,0:01:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,he's all business.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.13,0:01:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.59,0:01:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You look a bit worried,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.99,0:01:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,finally realizing that without\Nyour precious Exodia cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.51,0:01:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't stand a chance against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.19,0:01:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't need Exodia to defeat you, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.99,0:02:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If I keep drawing cards\Nlike this, you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.11,0:02:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I arm my genie with the D-Spell card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.21,0:02:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The D-Spell card can\Ndeactivate any magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.13,0:02:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's a loss I'm quite sure\Nyou can't afford, Yugi. Watch in!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.41,0:02:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My mystical genie of the lab!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.39,0:02:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate D-Spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.95,0:02:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.33,0:02:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Spell has destroyed your\NSwords of Revealing Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a tough loss, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.25,0:02:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your swords could have paralyzed\Nmy monsters for three turns,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.89,0:02:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but I guess now you'll just\Nlose three turns sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.33,0:02:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't count on it, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.67,0:02:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That genie's big trouble, but as\Nlong as he has the lamp to hide,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.11,0:02:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,then Yugi can't touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.61,0:02:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there any way to destroy the lamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.77,0:03:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This card might do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.39,0:03:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mystic Box.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.69,0:03:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be just the magic card I need\Nto evict La Jin from his ancient lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.29,0:03:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, I call upon the Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.25,0:03:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you put your\Nmagician at risk, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.97,0:03:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,when you have no idea what\NI have in store for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.91,0:03:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Then perhaps before I attack, I should\Nsee what you're planning for myself. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.03,0:03:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold my magic Eye of Truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.67,0:03:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So called because the\NEye of Truth knows all,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.51,0:03:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,sees all, and it will reveal\Nevery card in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.51,0:03:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.63,0:03:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a blue-eyes white dragon in\Nyour hand, but you haven't played it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.43,0:03:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You can always count\Non Kaiba to have a blue
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.81,0:03:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-eyes white dragon or three up his sneaky,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.03,0:03:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,slimy sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.94,0:03:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba sure loves his blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.83,0:03:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Three blue-eyes white dragons?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.01,0:04:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's got to be nearly\Nimpossible for Yugi to beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.95,0:04:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, Yugi's beaten three blue\Neyes before, and he'll beat him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.97,0:04:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Kaiba up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.67,0:04:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why hasn't he played his\Nblue-eyes white dragon yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.93,0:04:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi may have glimpsed\Nthe blue eyes in my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.81,0:04:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but I doubt that even he\Ncould guess what I'm planning,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.75,0:04:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,because it's never been done before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.91,0:04:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take all three of my\Nmighty Blue-Eyes White Dragons and
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.53,0:04:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,fuse them together into one incredible\Ncreature of unsurpassed power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.21,0:04:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The ultimate Blue-Eyes White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.93,0:04:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.15,0:04:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,the mundane magic of your wimpy Eye of\NTruth allowed you a sneak peek at my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.53,0:04:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But what good does it do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.29,0:04:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact still remains that your dark\Nmagician can't do anything against my genie,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.75,0:04:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,La Jin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.66,0:04:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Not while he has his lamp\Nto protect him. Then I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.05,0:04:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,extinguish it through the\Nmagic of my mystic box
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.81,0:04:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,now watch closely kaiba\Nas first my dark magician
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.03,0:05:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,is sealed within the box a\Ntrick it's much more than
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.77,0:05:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,a mere magic trick as\Nyou're about to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.25,0:05:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,kaiba now watch and be\Namazed as the mystic box is
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,skewered but have I destroyed\Nmy own dark magician
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.75,0:05:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,or have I magically\Nextinguished your ancient lamp,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.87,0:05:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,just as I promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.35,0:05:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, no, you've destroyed my genie's lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.07,0:05:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And the magic's only half done, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.77,0:05:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,for my dark magician emerges\Nfrom the mystic box unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.89,0:05:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.29,0:05:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You know a good magician\Nnever reveals his secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.93,0:05:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, dark magician, dark magic attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.95,0:05:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my genie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.15,0:05:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just as you said, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.33,0:05:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The ancient lamp may have protected\Nyour great genie, La Jinne.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.55,0:05:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But once it was destroyed, your genie\Nwas no match for my dark magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.31,0:05:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little magic show may\Nhave been entertaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.17,0:05:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But let's not lose perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.53,0:05:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You know I've got a blue\Neyes waiting in the wings,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.07,0:06:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and I know you have nothing\Nthat can stand against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.69,0:06:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You know nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.65,0:06:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Eye of Truth showed me your\Nhand, not the other way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.47,0:06:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to see your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.51,0:06:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think you need\Nto be taught a lesson,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.27,0:06:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll be happy to make my\Nnext play painfully instructive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.35,0:06:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This combination of Soggy the\NDark Clown and the Contagious
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.03,0:06:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush card should help me\Ninfect Yugi's life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.61,0:06:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, Soggy the Dark Clown!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.73,0:06:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Soggy the Dark Clown?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.03,0:06:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I was expecting Kaiba to sick\Nhis Blue-Eyes White Dragon on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.73,0:06:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows Soggy is no match\Nfor my Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.15,0:06:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.63,0:06:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't have any trap cards earlier\Nwhen I got a look at his hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.35,0:06:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but he might have drawn\Nsome new ones by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.19,0:06:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way to know\Nfor sure is to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.21,0:06:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But I dare not risk my Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.81,0:06:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician, return!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.45,0:07:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, good card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.37,0:07:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaia the Fierce Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He wiped the floor with Soggy\Nin my first duel with Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.47,0:07:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And he will defeat Soggy once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.17,0:07:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaia, the Fierce Knight, in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.21,0:07:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dark clown has\Nbeen vanquished, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.97,0:07:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Vanquished and sacrificed are\Ntwo very different things, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.67,0:07:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Look again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.81,0:07:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.55,0:07:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.75,0:07:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaia!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.71,0:07:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just Gaia, Yugi. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.61,0:07:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.93,0:07:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.85,0:07:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really quite ingenious, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.33,0:07:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing that you couldn't\Nresist attacking my Dark Clown,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.49,0:07:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I infected him with the Crush Card Virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.31,0:08:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,A Crush Card?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.31,0:08:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,By destroying the infected Soggy,\Nyou released the Crush Card Virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.19,0:08:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,A virus that is so\Nhighly contagious to duel
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.01,0:08:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters that even as I speak these words,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.99,0:08:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,it is infecting all but the weakest\Ncards in your precious dueling deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.13,0:08:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No! My cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.09,0:08:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The only monsters unaffected\Nby the Crush Card Virus
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.49,0:08:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,are those with an attack\Npower weaker than 1500.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.99,0:08:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I've broken the\Nheart of your cards, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.81,0:08:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That crush card Kaiba used to\Ninfect my deck makes it so I
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.15,0:08:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,can't use any monsters with\Nmore than 1,500 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.53,0:08:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well played, but it will take more\Nthan a virus to win this duel, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.09,0:08:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I expect that it will, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.31,0:08:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.31,0:08:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to subjecting you\Nto a wide array of debilitating cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.73,0:09:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep talking the talk, Big Mouth Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.37,0:09:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't forget that\NYugi beat you last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.01,0:09:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and now Yugi's an\Neven better duelist. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,but last time he didn't\Nhave a crush card forcing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.59,0:09:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,him to play just magic\Ncards and weak monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.21,0:09:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He's only allowed to play magic\Ncards and his wimpiest creatures?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.13,0:09:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll still win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.29,0:09:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is turning out to be\Nquite the show. All I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.39,0:09:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,really missing is a hot\Ndog and a bag of popcorn
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.95,0:09:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,oh well from the looks\Nof things this duel isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.89,0:09:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna last long enough for\Nme to enjoy them anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.29,0:09:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,besides getting the lowdown\Non these chumps dueling
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.43,0:09:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,strategies is plenty for\Nme to snack on your turn
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.85,0:09:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,yugi let's see how your\Ndisease ridden deck serves
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.71,0:09:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,you now you may have\Ninfected the body of my deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.43,0:09:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, but it is the heart of the cards\Nthat will see me through this contamination.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.07,0:09:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The Summoned Skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.25,0:09:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't use him because his\Nattack points are over 1,500.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.75,0:10:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's Crush card would infect him\Nthe second I laid him on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.27,0:10:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Face it, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.41,0:10:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,To continue playing in this duel, you'll\Nhave to serve up your weakest monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.61,0:10:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.53,0:10:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, that's all I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.41,0:10:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Silverfang!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.32,0:10:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.33,0:10:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And his attack points are low enough\Nto make him immune to your virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.41,0:10:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.41,0:10:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ironic that a wolf will be the first of\Nyour sacrificial lambs, but so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.35,0:10:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the second of my three\Nblue-eyes white dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.61,0:10:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one more now, and then absolutely\Nnothing will be able to keep me from victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.69,0:10:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, with one earth-shattering blast,\NI'll defeat Yugi for the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.21,0:10:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I've finished him,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.01,0:10:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go after Pegasus and rescue\Nmy brother from his demented grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.51,0:10:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But while I'm waiting\Nfor my third Blue Eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.37,0:10:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll clear the field\Nof Yugi's rabid beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.51,0:11:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Battle Ox, awaken and let\Nloose the dogs of war!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.47,0:11:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Axe Slam Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.21,0:11:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your puppy has been put down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.61,0:11:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.73,0:11:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a minor setback, no\Nbig deal! Come on, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.01,0:11:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can win this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.63,0:11:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's ever beaten you in\Na duel, and no one ever will!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.27,0:11:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your pitiful defenses can't even withstand\Nthe crude assaults of my battle ox!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.89,0:11:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you expect to protect your life\Npoints when your defenses are demolished
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.45,0:11:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and you have nothing left to shield you\Nagainst my even more powerful monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.65,0:11:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll find out soon enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.53,0:11:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.49,0:11:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,but how can I defeat any\Nmonster when his crush
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.79,0:11:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,card forces me to play\Nmy weakest creatures?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.19,0:11:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You should accept your fate for now, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.83,0:11:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you'll have the rest of your\Nentire life to brood over this defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.89,0:11:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't give in to his taunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.43,0:11:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come here to rescue my grandpa,\Nand I can't let Kaiba defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.25,0:12:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Grifor! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.67,0:12:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.67,0:12:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see you deal with\Nthis attack, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.05,0:12:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A Grifor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.41,0:12:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you've made a\Ngrave miscalculation, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.59,0:12:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,His pathetic defenses are\Nno match for my battle ox.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.87,0:12:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever said that I was going to be\Nplaying him in defense mode, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.05,0:12:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.63,0:12:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm attacking with my Grifor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.79,0:12:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,With the help of my Horn of the Unicorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.31,0:12:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic lightning combo attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.09,0:12:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Your battle-ox has been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.69,0:12:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm feeling\Na comeback in the works.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.91,0:12:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Stellar move!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.11,0:12:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Good show, that was a brilliant\Nplay at a critical junction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.97,0:12:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Yugi, great move!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.79,0:13:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive, Yugi, using a combo attack\Nto combat the perils of my virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.07,0:13:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid that there are some hazards\Nin my deck that are simply inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.55,0:13:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.03,0:13:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,At last!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.45,0:13:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all I need is a polymerization\Ncard to merge them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.35,0:13:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself for\Nultimate annihilation, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.17,0:13:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, I'm invoking the Mystical Elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.35,0:13:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.61,0:13:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,if there's one thing I've\Nlearned in my matches with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.99,0:13:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,it's that you have an uncanny ability for\Nsnatching victory from the jaws of defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.17,0:13:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't intend to give\Nyou such an opportunity today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.31,0:13:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is why I've summoned the Mystical\NElf to reinforce my life points by 300.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.35,0:13:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen Kaiba duel\Nso methodically before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.51,0:13:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Every move he plays is so precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.09,0:13:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He's leaving nothing to chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.95,0:13:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if, to him, this were\Na battle of life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.77,0:13:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.25,0:13:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon I'll have completed\NPegasus's twisted little
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.75,0:13:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,task and then nothing will\Nstop me from rescuing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.15,0:14:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, once I defeat Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.27,0:14:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.43,0:14:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The mighty Blue-Eyes White Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.27,0:14:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Yugi, your fate belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.65,0:14:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Take flight, Blue-Eyes White Dragon, rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.51,0:14:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, White Lightning Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.23,0:14:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.01,0:14:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Already my blue eyes has you cowering.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.71,0:14:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is only the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, you will know what fear is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.03,0:15:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't fear your blue eyes, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.47,0:15:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I've defeated him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.75,0:15:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And with my giant soldier of stone guarding\Nme, I'll manage to defeat him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.85,0:15:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.87,0:15:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, when you battled my blue eyes\Nbefore, they were three separate dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.09,0:15:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Formidable, yes, but not invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.75,0:15:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I've found a way\Nto merge their power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.65,0:15:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,combine their attack points to create...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.27,0:15:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A monster with power beyond imagining!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.99,0:15:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I create a dual monster without peer,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.11,0:15:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,with attack force so great that\Nno monster can stand against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.79,0:15:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I create the Blue Eyes Ultimate Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.61,0:15:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why he didn't\Nplay his Blue Eyes at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.25,0:15:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He was waiting to merge them all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.21,0:16:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, there's no escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.07,0:16:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can save you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.91,0:16:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That monster's attack\Npoints are all the charts!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.67,0:16:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, how could any creature in\NYu-Gi's deck beat that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.39,0:16:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.63,0:16:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been setting Yu-Gi up for\Nthat beast this entire time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.99,0:16:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi is done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.17,0:16:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba had that little twerp on the ropes,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.03,0:16:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and now this ultimate blue eyes is\Ngonna knock him out of the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.39,0:16:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.05,0:16:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It just can't. Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.79,0:16:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,find a way to come back. I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.35,0:16:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba has really played\Na brilliant strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.89,0:16:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting me up with that crush card,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.67,0:16:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,holding out for all\Nthree of his blue eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.57,0:16:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and at the same time whittling down\Nmy life points to a sparse 400.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's got me cornered and staring down\Nthe toughest monster I've ever faced.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.35,0:16:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, how I savor this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.11,0:16:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the moment I've been waiting for,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.23,0:17:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,ever since you handed me my first\Nand only Duel Monster's defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.03,0:17:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself to see the\Npower of my creature unleashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-Eyes Ultimate White Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.17,0:17:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Neutron Blast Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.57,0:17:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.51,0:17:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My Stone Soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.97,0:17:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky your Stone Soldier\Nwas in defense mode. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.33,0:17:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,At least Yugi didn't lose any life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.99,0:17:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Soldier was the last of my defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.37,0:17:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon\Natomized your creature to dust, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.45,0:17:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You know you have nothing\Nto stand against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.71,0:17:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You should concede.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You can win this. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.67,0:17:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We all believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.35,0:17:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta remember what\Nyou're fighting for, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.27,0:17:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The heart of the cards, just\Nlike your grandpa taught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.63,0:17:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never let anyone down before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.77,0:17:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and I know you're not gonna\Nlet your grandpa down now
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.87,0:17:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, I won't let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.71,0:18:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to keep fighting for you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.99,0:18:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No Kaiba, I will never\Nsurrender to the likes of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.91,0:18:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it That's the\Nkind of determination.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I expect from you fight on
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.05,0:18:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather every last bit\Nof your strength, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.43,0:18:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I prefer to take you down when\Nyou're fighting your hardest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.31,0:18:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything rides on this last card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.03,0:18:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel, this tournament, my grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.69,0:18:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But as hopeless as it seems,\NI still have to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.61,0:18:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.79,0:18:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it, pal. Believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.23,0:18:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick butt, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.19,0:18:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It comes to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.85,0:18:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So draw your card and face your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.05,0:18:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.23,0:18:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Guide me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.65,0:18:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's finish this, Kaiba.
